Third-party notices
===================

This repository contains only original source code written for this port, plus
small tools. It distributes no game data and no third-party binaries.

1. Touhou Project / 東方Project
   The game being ported, its artwork, music, text and characters are the
   property of ZUN / Team Shanghai Alice (上海アリス幻樂団).
   This is an unofficial fan project (二次創作). You must own the original game
   to build a runnable copy.

2. libth03 / th98port  —  https://github.com/christianazinn/th98port
   Fetched at a pinned commit by bootstrap.ps1. It provides the PI, RGB and
   BFT asset decoders and the vendored TinySoundFont build used by this port.
   It is NOT redistributed here; bootstrap.ps1 fetches it from its own
   repository, and its own terms apply. The repository has no
   top-level license file, so treat it as all rights reserved and ask its
   author before redistributing its sources.

3. TinySoundFont (reached through libth03's third_party directory)
