4. GeneralUser GS v1.44 SoundFont — http://www.schristiancollins.com
   Runtime data only, NOT included. Its "License v2.0" allows use in software
   projects and modification of the bank or its packaging; keep the license
   text next to any copy you redistribute. `tools/slim_soundfont.py` can
   derive a TH02-only subset locally.

5. ReC98 — https://github.com/nmlgc/ReC98
   Research reference for the original PC-98 code. No ReC98 source is copied
   into or redistributed by this repository.

6. app_icon.ico
   Generated procedurally by `tools/gen_icon.py`; it contains no
   third-party artwork.

